    rdfs:label "Al foil" ;
    weee:description "Al foil is a source-specific Component entity in the study Heat Treatment of Licoo2 Recovered from Cathode Scraps with Solvent Method. Scope: Al foil separated from the LiCoO2 cathode scraps during the solvent recovery; impure Al foil mixtures (Al foil, active material, acetylene black) were obtained after the first separation and further treated." ;
