    weee:description "Leaching tests were performed according to European Standard Procedures (EN – 12457 – 2). All the seven sub-samples (reported in Fig. 1) were put in contact with distilled water in capped bottles. Liquid to solid ratio was 10/1 and the suspension was agitated by an overhead shaker (5 rpm) for 24 h at room temperature (20 ± 5 ^).." ;
