    weee:description "After the solution reached the required values and stabilized at the specified temperature, 20 g of spent LIBs powder was added, and the reaction was timed. After the reaction time, the beaker was removed and left to cool to room temperature. Then, the leachate and leach residue were separated by vacuum filtration, and the metal content of the leach solution was measured." ;
