    rdfs:label "nitric acid acidic digestion" ;
    weee:description "nitric acid acidic digestion is a source-specific Process entity in the study Assessment of Smartphones’ Components and Materials for a Recycling Perspective- Tendencies of Composition and Target Elements. Scope: Digestions were performed with analytical grade aqua regia (3:1 chloride acid and nitric acid). In parallel, another set of digestions (in the same conditions) were performed using nitric acid due to possible precipitation of chlorides in aqua regia." ;
