<http://weee-kg.org/source:Bioleaching%20of%20Valuable%20Metals%20from%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Mobile%20Phone%20Batteries%20Using%20Aspergillus%20Niger:Process_control_bioleaching> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "control bioleaching" ;
    weee:description "control bioleaching is a source-specific Process entity in the study Bioleaching of Valuable Metals from Spent Lithium-Ion Mobile Phone Batteries Using Aspergillus Niger. Scope: A control experiment was performed in a parallel manner, using fresh sucrose medium without inoculation. Quantitative observations concern: Cu, Li." ;
