        <http://weee-kg.org/source:Chemical%20Characterisation%20of%20Spent%20Rechargeable%20Batteries:Observation_REL_Process_EN_12457_2_leaching_test_HAS_OUTPUT_Material_Cu_f9c6b2cabe038200>,
        <http://weee-kg.org/source:Chemical%20Characterisation%20of%20Spent%20Rechargeable%20Batteries:Observation_REL_Process_EN_12457_2_leaching_test_HAS_OUTPUT_Material_Fe_5b29f6961b6a8808>,
        <http://weee-kg.org/source:Chemical%20Characterisation%20of%20Spent%20Rechargeable%20Batteries:Observation_REL_Process_EN_12457_2_leaching_test_HAS_OUTPUT_Material_Fe_d7b0074c051b1639>,
