<http://weee-kg.org/source:Leaching%20Lithium%20from%20the%20Anode%20Electrode%20Materials%20of%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Batteries%20by%20Hydrochloric%20Acid%20%28Hcl%29:Process_reviewed_8daa8098cc6a94> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "hydrochloric acid leaching of calcined anode powder without H2O2" ;
    weee:description "hydrochloric acid leaching of calcined anode powder without H2O2 is a source-specific Process entity in the study Leaching Lithium from the Anode Electrode Materials of Spent Lithium-Ion Batteries by Hydrochloric Acid (Hcl). Scope: Being a solid–liquid reaction, the leaching process was mainly influenced by the concentration of hydrochloric acid, _ H Cl - H2O2 volume ratio, solid–liquid ratio, leaching time, and temperature and agitation rate. Quantitative observations concern: Li." ;
    weee:hasScopeContext <http://weee-kg.org/context/scope/a924e4b5ed8c45795c760c71> ;
    rel:hasResultObservation <http://weee-kg.org/source:Leaching%20Lithium%20from%20the%20Anode%20Electrode%20Materials%20of%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Batteries%20by%20Hydrochloric%20Acid%20%28Hcl%29:Observation_REL_reviewed_283200192ce04a28_abf4e8c22dd439bf> ;
    rel:memberOfMethodFamily <http://weee-kg.org/anchor:MethodFamily:acid_leaching> .

<http://weee-kg.org/source:Leaching%20Lithium%20from%20the%20Anode%20Electrode%20Materials%20of%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Batteries%20by%20Hydrochloric%20Acid%20%28Hcl%29:Process_reviewed_c2ca1a770bfa07> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "deionized water leaching of calcined anode powder" ;
    weee:description "deionized water leaching of calcined anode powder is a source-specific Process entity in the study Leaching Lithium from the Anode Electrode Materials of Spent Lithium-Ion Batteries by Hydrochloric Acid (Hcl). Scope: Because some of them are water-soluble, such as ROCO2 Li CH3OLi Li2O,, in the experiment performed it has a high leaching efficiency of lithium (84%) only in deionized water. Quantitative observations concern: Li." ;
    weee:hasScopeContext <http://weee-kg.org/context/scope/a53fdfa29477d48c54572666> ;
    rel:hasResultObservation <http://weee-kg.org/source:Leaching%20Lithium%20from%20the%20Anode%20Electrode%20Materials%20of%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Batteries%20by%20Hydrochloric%20Acid%20%28Hcl%29:Observation_REL_reviewed_a9a09b1adf9bea5e_766f1df6e3b81975> ;
