        <http://weee-kg.org/source:Bioleaching%20of%20Valuable%20Metals%20from%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Mobile%20Phone%20Batteries%20Using%20Aspergillus%20Niger:Observation_REL_Process_one_step_bioleaching_HAS_OUTPUT_Material_Li_4a48658cdfd296df>,
        <http://weee-kg.org/source:Bioleaching%20of%20Valuable%20Metals%20from%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Mobile%20Phone%20Batteries%20Using%20Aspergillus%20Niger:Observation_REL_Process_one_step_bioleaching_HAS_OUTPUT_Material_Mn_0249a9275aa7bafe> ;
