<http://weee-kg.org/source:Bioleaching%20of%20Valuable%20Metals%20from%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Mobile%20Phone%20Batteries%20Using%20Aspergillus%20Niger:Process_spent_medium_bioleaching> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "spent medium bioleaching" ;
    weee:description "spent medium bioleaching is a source-specific Process entity in the study Bioleaching of Valuable Metals from Spent Lithium-Ion Mobile Phone Batteries Using Aspergillus Niger. Scope: In the spent medium process, the fungi were primarily cultured in sucrose medium without battery powder until the fungi entered the stationary phase, which took 14 days for the A. niger. Quantitative observations concern: Al, Co, Cu, Li, Mn." ;
    weee:hasScopeContext <http://weee-kg.org/context/scope/67b35ae6f7c5475640fd36cb> ;
