<http://weee-kg.org/source:Comprehensive%20Evaluation%20on%20Effective%20Leaching%20of%20Critical%20Metals%20from%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Batteries:Process_acidic_leaching_of_cathode> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "acidic leaching of cathode" ;
    weee:description "acidic leaching of cathode is a source-specific Process entity in the study Comprehensive Evaluation on Effective Leaching of Critical Metals from Spent Lithium-Ion Batteries. Scope: The cathode scrap was leached in a 50 mL sealed reactor which was placed in a temperature controlled shaking bath. The acidic solution was added to the reactor with a volume of 25 mL. The leaching conditions including acid species, acid concentration, reductant content and pH of the leaching solution were examined. Quantitative observations concern: Al, Co, Li." ;
    weee:hasScopeContext <http://weee-kg.org/context/scope/bb8e4ebc1405708ab1a46ce5> ;
    rel:hasResultObservation <http://weee-kg.org/source:Comprehensive%20Evaluation%20on%20Effective%20Leaching%20of%20Critical%20Metals%20from%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Batteries:Observation_REL_Process_acidic_leaching_of_cathode_HAS_OUTPUT_Material_Al_014121efc5de8afc>,
