<http://weee-kg.org/source:Heat%20Treatment%20of%20Licoo2%20Recovered%20from%20Cathode%20Scraps%20with%20Solvent%20Method:Process_solvent_method_for_scrap_material_recovery> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "solvent method for scrap material recovery" ;
    weee:description "solvent method for scrap material recovery is a source-specific Process entity in the study Heat Treatment of Licoo2 Recovered from Cathode Scraps with Solvent Method. Scope: a new solvent method with inexpensive mixture of N,N-Dimethylformamide (DMF) and ethanol was used to remove PVDF and recover scrap materials from LiCoO2 scraps Quantitative observations concern: acetylene black, cathode active material." ;
