<http://weee-kg.org/source:Assessment%20of%20Smartphones%E2%80%99%20Components%20and%20Materials%20for%20a%20Recycling%20Perspective-%20Tendencies%20of%20Composition%20and%20Target%20Elements:Component_Entire> a weee:Component ;
    rdfs:label "Entire" ;
    weee:description "Entire is a source-specific Component entity in the study Assessment of Smartphones’ Components and Materials for a Recycling Perspective- Tendencies of Composition and Target Elements. Scope: The 'entire' device corresponds to the same 30 collected end-of-life smartphones, analyzed as whole devices (entire smartphones) in addition to their separated components. Quantitative observations concern: Metals, Others, Polymers." ;
