<http://weee-kg.org/source:Assessment%20of%20Smartphones%E2%80%99%20Components%20and%20Materials%20for%20a%20Recycling%20Perspective-%20Tendencies%20of%20Composition%20and%20Target%20Elements:Process_thermal_treatment__loss_on_ignition_> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "thermal treatment (loss on ignition)" ;
    weee:description "thermal treatment (loss on ignition) is a source-specific Process entity in the study Assessment of Smartphones’ Components and Materials for a Recycling Perspective- Tendencies of Composition and Target Elements. Scope: It is usual to perform a thermal treatment (also called loss on ignition) on e-waste to evaporate volatile compounds, and consider this fraction as an approximation of polymers [25, 26]. Three samples of each of the eight groups were submitted to thermal treatment" ;
    weee:hasScopeContext <http://weee-kg.org/context/scope/383baf46ce7a17f82020295c> ;
    rel:memberOfMethodFamily <http://weee-kg.org/anchor:MethodFamily:loss_on_ignition> .

<http://weee-kg.org/source:Assessment%20of%20Smartphones%E2%80%99%20Components%20and%20Materials%20for%20a%20Recycling%20Perspective-%20Tendencies%20of%20Composition%20and%20Target%20Elements:Product_mobile_phone> a weee:Product ;
    rdfs:label "mobile phone" ;
    weee:description "mobile phone is a source-specific Product entity in the study Assessment of Smartphones’ Components and Materials for a Recycling Perspective- Tendencies of Composition and Target Elements. Scope: 30 end-of-life smartphones collected directly from users via social media announcements, from nine different brands with no repeated model, distributed across manufacturing years before and after 2015 (15 devices per group). Directly contains: Ag, Al, Au, Ba, Co." ;
