<http://weee-kg.org/source:Ultrasound-Assisted%20Leaching%20of%20Cobalt%20and%20Lithium%20from%20Spent%20Lithium-Ion%20Batteries:Process_ultrasound_assisted_leaching_of_Co_and_Li_from_calcined_cathode_material> a weee:Process ;
    rdfs:label "ultrasound-assisted leaching of Co and Li from calcined cathode material" ;
    weee:description "ultrasound-assisted leaching of Co and Li from calcined cathode material is a source-specific Process entity in the study Ultrasound-Assisted Leaching of Cobalt and Lithium from Spent Lithium-Ion Batteries. Scope: The ultrasonic probe was placed in the solution during the ultrasound-assisted leaching experiments. The ultrasonic waves were generated by the ultrasonic generator (XC98-IIDN, Nanjing NingKai Instrument Co. Ltd., Nanjing, China) with a frequency of 20 KHz at varying power in the range from 100 W to 1000 W. Quantitative observations concern: Co, Li." ;
    weee:hasScopeContext <http://weee-kg.org/context/scope/655a68f42c5789f5ce27c541> ;
